{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"MGASA-2026-0483","published":"2026-10-12T18:47:12Z","modified":"2026-10-12T19:13:25.022728597Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-105326","CVE-2026-55453","CVE-2026-55467","CVE-2026-55480","CVE-2026-61702","CVE-2026-87875","CVE-2026-87876"],"summary":"Updated cups package fixes security vulnerabilities","details":"CUPS ipp backend status-line injection can update queue PPD and lead to\nconditional RCE as lp via foomatic-rip. (CVE-2026-55453)\nCUPS fax option values bypass the CVE-2026-34980 control-character\nsanitizer (incomplete fix). (CVE-2026-55467)\ncopy_model() creates a predictable PPD tempfile without\nO_EXCL/O_NOFOLLOW. (CVE-2026-55480)\nroot-side banner file disclosure. (CVE-2026-61702)\nHeap out-of-bounds read in cupsUTF32ToUTF8() via missing source-length\nbound — reachable from SNMP supply-description parsing\n(backend/snmp-supplies.c). (CVE-2026-87875)\nCVE-2026-27447 follow-up: remaining case-insensitive username matching\nin scheduler side paths. (CVE-2026-87876)\nArgument injection in mailto notifier allows unauthenticated remote code\nexecution. (CVE-2026-105326)\n","affected":[{"package":{"name":"cups","ecosystem":"Mageia:10","purl":"pkg:rpm/mageia/cups?arch=source&distro=mageia-10"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"2.4.20-1.mga10"}]}],"ecosystem_specific":{"section":"core"},"database_specific":{"source":"https://advisories.mageia.org/MGASA-2026-0483.json"}}],"references":[{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://advisories.mageia.org/MGASA-2026-0483.html"},{"type":"REPORT","url":"https://bugs.mageia.org/show_bug.cgi?id=36331"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://lists.opensuse.org/archives/list/security-announce@lists.opensuse.org/message/KX5YFUOJ5JKV64QGD4WMERKGBI43OV3M/"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://github.com/OpenPrinting/cups/security/advisories/GHSA-559w-7676-3xrq"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2026/10/05/6"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://github.com/OpenP